AUDIO: 'and the operator can take care of the printer, and everything just works together. Let\'s go through it. So, what you\'re looking at is the dashboard of the 3DPN Print Manager. At the top, you can see your utilization. That\'s because'

[02:04] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'not all machines are running at this time. You get a a parts today, a parts count over 24 hours. You have your time. And that little circle in the upper upper right is the refresh. It\'s the polling. It\'s not consistently polling'

[02:17] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'all of these machines. It It runs at a configured time. And again, this is local network. This does not have a cloud component. This does not have a'

