VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'login. This exists within a private network. This is the dashboard. Yeah, I talked about the things at the top. So, below that is fleet status. And you can see I\'ve got Core 1, Mark 4S,'

[02:43] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'and XL machines. Green means the print has finished on that machine and it needs to be harvested. Blue means it is still printing. And orange means it needs my attention. Usually, it means that'

